{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026DJpLD2tcER1794218467.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>女子網球年終賽，歌芙分組賽首場擊敗佩古娜。</p><p></p><p>八位球手分兩組，爭入四強。藍色裙的歌芙所屬的第一組，有拉芭堅娜退賽，由高絲迪沃補上。這位世界第四球手，首場面對同樣美國的佩古娜，先贏6-4後，第二盤打到決勝局，輸「細分」5-7。</p><p></p><p>歌芙決勝盤回勇，憑三次破發，再贏6-2，在分組賽旗開得勝，下場對諾絲高娃。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:42:03.666365+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T09:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:10.317825+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T10:35:53.116986+00:00","content_hash":"8f650896a8460fbd586782565861924f6f87aab2c670753e4795c75b25f849d0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}